                "text": "Thirteen percent of current military households relied on a nutrition assistance program last year. President Biden, alongside our Military Quality of Life panel, took historic steps to raise pay for junior enlisted troops and help end military hunger \u2014 but the current administration is now choosing to undo that progress.   That\u2019s not a constraint \u2014 that\u2019s a choice.\n\nThat\u2019s not a budget problem \u2014 that\u2019s a moral one. \n\nhttps://t.co/f37gP0Wo6T",
